---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import InspirationPhoto from '../components/InspirationPhoto.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import { business } from '../data/site';
---
<Base
  title="About Us"
  description="Coastal Bama is a Gulf Shores cabinet painting company focused on one thing: durable, factory-smooth cabinet finishes for coastal Alabama homes."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="About"
    title="One trade, done well"
    lede="A Gulf Shores company that paints cabinets and nothing else."
  />

  <section class="section wrap grid-2">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lede">{business.name} is a {business.city} company that paints cabinets and nothing else. No walls, no exteriors, no decks.</p>
      <p>Cabinets are the hardest thing in a house to paint well. They get grabbed, bumped, steamed and wiped every day. A finish that looks fine on a wall will chip on a cabinet door in months. Doing only cabinets lets us keep the right sprayers, primers and drying setup for the job, and lets our crew get very good at it.</p>
      <p>We started the business because so many kitchens along the coast are in good shape structurally but look dated: honey oak, cherry stain, or builder white that has gone yellow. Repainting is usually the fastest and most affordable way to fix that.</p>
      <!-- TODO: add owner name, founding year and a short personal story -->
      <InspirationPhoto caption="The kind of bright coastal kitchen we like to help people get without a remodel." />
    </div>
    <div class="stack">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>How we work</h3>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>A written quote with a fixed price</li>
          <li>A written schedule with start and finish dates</li>
          <li>The same crew from start to finish</li>
          <li>Licensed and insured, with certificates available for HOAs</li>
          <li>A clean job site every evening</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Why the name</h3>
        <p>Coastal Alabama, from Fort Morgan to Perdido, is where we live and where we work. The name says exactly that.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</Base>
